  <item>
    <title>“质疑xx理解xx成为xx”“血脉觉醒”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6653653e4efbc0c3dc3370b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6653653e4efbc0c3dc3370b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 16:37:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>曾经我们有很多不理解的行为</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是随着我们慢慢长大</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们竟然开始理解</span></p><span></span><p><span>并且逐渐成为那样的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们需要做的是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>做自己！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> 《爱情公寓》？？！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> &nbsp;凤凰传奇 土？俗？喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 打麻将一坐坐一天？多么美妙的事情！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 打台球只打白球进洞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> 脆皮大学生学中式养生！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 在教学楼晕倒？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 鱼腥草吃or不吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 长成了我们讨厌的长辈的样子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 开盲盒是个无底洞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 安陵容，可怜之人必有可恨之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 英子！不内耗自己，去外耗他人！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（BGM：单依纯《爱的回归线》）</span></p>]]></description>
