    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Apr 2024 11:37:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>总是纠结该不该买？花多少钱？值不值得？</span></p><span></span><p><span>到底什么样的消费观才是正向的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的钱都花哪去啦！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>请点击播放我们的消费指南～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 我们稀奇古怪的消费观？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> &nbsp;和吃同等重要的是——游戏！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> &nbsp;消费的体验感&gt;物品本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 可以买贵的 但不能买贵了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> &nbsp;怎么还整上等级观、嫡庶观了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> &nbsp;购物节嘛 多少参与一下！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> &nbsp;别再提我的恋爱脑啦！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> &nbsp;收获到价值的消费观就是正向的</span></p>]]></description>
